   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "# sing-wan22-s2v\nWan 2.2 S2V 14B: one start frame + a vocal track -> a singing performance. Full 20 steps, cfg 6, one chunk.\nAudio-driven like the LTX dialogue workflows, but **no end frame** (S2V can't pin one).\n\n**Inputs:** `in_start_image`, `in_audio` (the **vocal stem** slice for the shot, not the full mix; wav2vec2 hears\nthe drums otherwise), `in_prompt` (delivery and camera, not appearance), `in_seconds` = audio length. Frames = 4n+1 at 16 fps.\n\n**Length:** one chunk is trained at 77 frames (4.8 s). Shots up to ~5.5 s work in one chunk; for longer lines use the\nofficial template `video_wan2_2_14B_s2v`, which chains extend chunks.\n\n`in_size`: S2V is a 480p/720p-class model. 1024x576 is the 16:9 default here; 1280x720 is heavier.\nWan renders 16 fps; interpolate for the 24 fps edit."
   ],
   "title": "sing-wan22-s2v: how to use"
  }
 ],
